                shape: RoundedRectangleBorder(borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(12)),
              ),
              onPressed: onNext,
              child: const Text('Next', style: TextStyle(color: Colors.white)),
            ),
          ),
        ],
      ),
    );
  }
}

